# Paradigm checks for find-accent-misspellings.py: a plain form is a real
# verb form when its stem plus an infinitive ending is a known word
# (duvidas/dúvidas: duvidar; media/média: medir; continuara/continuará:
# continuar).
paradigm-plain o ar er ir
paradigm-plain a ar er ir
paradigm-plain e ar er ir
paradigm-plain as ar er ir
paradigm-plain es ar er ir
paradigm-plain am ar er ir
paradigm-plain em ar er ir
paradigm-plain ia er ir
paradigm-plain ias er ir
paradigm-plain ara ar
paradigm-plain era er
paradigm-plain ira ir

# find-respellings.py: the 2009 spelling reform (Acordo Ortográfico de 1990),
# which the AOSP list predates (idéia, vôo, cinqüenta). `list`: the list's
# words may be old; `always`: no exceptions in lowercase words.
# Trema: cinqüenta -> cinquenta, lingüiça -> linguiça.
respell ([gq])ü \1u always list
# Open diphthongs éi, ói in paroxytones (one syllable after them, not
# ending in r, l, n, x, ps): idéia -> ideia, heróico -> heroico; papéis,
# herói, destróier keep the accent.
respell éi(?=[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*[aeiouãõ]+[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*$)(?![a-zç]*(?:[rlnx]|ps)$) ei always list
respell ói(?=[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*[aeiouãõ]+[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*$)(?![a-zç]*(?:[rlnx]|ps)$) oi always list
# Stressed i, u after a diphthong in paroxytones: feiúra -> feiura.
respell (?<=[aeiou][iu])í(?=[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*[aeiouãõ]+[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*$) i always list
respell (?<=[aeiou][iu])ú(?=[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*[aeiouãõ]+[b-df-hj-np-tv-zç]*$) u always list
# Stressed u of gue, gui, que, qui: averigúe -> averigue, argúi -> argui.
respell (?<=[gq])ú(?=[ei]) u list
# Double o, -eem: vôo -> voo, vêem -> veem.
respell ôo oo always list
respell êem$ eem always list
# Differential accents: pára -> para, pêlo -> pelo, pólo -> polo, pêra -> pera
# (pôr and pôde keep theirs).
respell ^pára$ para always list
respell ^p[éê]l([oa]s?)$ pel\1 always list
respell ^pólo(s?)$ polo\1 always list
respell ^pêra(s?)$ pera\1 always list
respell ^côa(s?)$ coa\1 always list
